---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/homepage.css';

// Mentaat's own Privacy Policy, composed entirely from existing design-system
// component classes. Starting template; have counsel review before launch.
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Mentaat"
  description="How Mentaat collects, uses, and protects information through this website."
>
  <div id="__next">
    <div class="app_site--homepage__E5h5V app_loggedOut__HHvfJ">
      <div class="Flex_flex___mzvZ Flex_direction--column__TTxLV Flex_justify--space-between__LdB4V Layout_layout__u6BrU">
        <div class="Flex_flex___mzvZ Flex_direction--column__TTxLV Flex_justify--start__vk9Tl Layout_content__q1d4E">
          <Header />
          <main class="Layout_main__nbmiJ">
            <div class="Flex_flex___mzvZ Flex_direction--column__TTxLV Flex_justify--start__vk9Tl Flex_gap--m__j4Ha1">
              <h1 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--02__GxsbA">Privacy Policy</h1>

              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">Effective date: June 27, 2026</p>

              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT"><em>This is a starting template and must be reviewed by counsel before launch.</em></p>

              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">Mentaat Technologies LLC ("Mentaat," "we," "us") is a New Jersey software and AI consulting studio. We respect your privacy. This policy explains what we collect through this website, how we use it, and your choices.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Information we collect</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">When you contact us, book a call, or fill out a form on this site, we collect what you provide, such as your name, business, email address, and anything you write to us. Like most websites, we may also collect basic technical and usage data, such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited, through cookies and analytics.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">How we use it</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">We use this information to respond to you, schedule and prepare for conversations, provide and improve our services, and operate and secure the site. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Who we share it with</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">We share information only with service providers who help us operate the site and our business, such as hosting, email, scheduling, and analytics providers, and only as needed to do that work. We never sell your personal information. We may disclose information if required by law.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Cookies and analytics</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">This site uses cookies for basic functionality and, where enabled, for analytics that help us understand how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Data retention</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">We keep your information for as long as needed to respond to you and run our business, then delete or anonymize it.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Your rights</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">You may ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information you have given us by emailing hello@mentaat.com. We use reasonable measures to protect your information, though no method of transmission or storage is perfectly secure. This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">Changes to this policy</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">We may update this policy. The effective date above will reflect the latest version.</p>

              <h2 class="Heading_heading__me6NI Heading_heading--05__4gkI8">How to contact us</h2>
              <p class="Text_text__4F9CK Text_color--secondary__oRE1u Text_size--body--01__aiSyT">Questions about this policy can be sent to hello@mentaat.com. Mentaat Technologies LLC, New Jersey.</p>
            </div>
          </main>
        </div>
        <Footer />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
